WEBVTT

00:00:00.371 --> 00:00:07.667
Product Releases tracks every version of the products you build. In this video, you’ll add a version and follow it on its dashboard.

00:00:08.695 --> 00:00:17.655
Open Product Releases. Each product lists its versions, soonest first, with their status and due date. Released versions fold away underneath.

00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:28.326
Click New version, and give it a number, a name, and a release date. Anyone can add versions; System Admins add the products themselves, in the Admin console.

00:00:29.345 --> 00:00:38.518
Open a version for its own dashboard: progress, open and overdue tickets, and who’s working on what. Tickets join a version through their Target release.
